    /// The fields of a packed descriptor in which some fields share bits
    /// (the members of a union): `arm` names the members (v10.xml's field
    /// paths) the bytes hold; every other member is left at zero. Refuses a
    /// set bit that no fixed field or chosen member owns, a name that is no
    /// member, and two chosen members that share a bit.
